From: BeaverOS <dev@beaveros.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] meson: define gst_version_is_dev

The root meson.build references gst_version_is_dev, but the variable is
only defined in the gst-plugins-bad tree this repository was forked from.
Meson aborts with "Unknown variable" before any target is configured.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [vendor fork]
---
 meson.build | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -20,6 +20,8 @@ libversion = '@0@.@1@.0'.format(soversion, gst_version_minor * 100 + gst_version_micro)
 
 plugins_install_dir = '@0@/gstreamer-1.0'.format(get_option('libdir'))
 
+gst_version_is_dev = gst_version_minor.is_odd()
+
 cc = meson.get_compiler('c')
 
 # Symbol visibility
